  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 114,
    "summary": "The Lord governs the sea and the land for the blessing of His people.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "When Israel went out of Egypt, the house of Jacob from a people of strange language;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "Ex. 13:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Judah was his sanctuary, and Israel his dominion.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The sea saw it, and fled: Jordan was driven back.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "Ex. 14:21 (21–22); Ps. 78:13."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 15
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The mountains skipped like rams, and the little hills like lambs.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 36
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "What ailed thee, O thou sea, that thou fleddest? thou Jordan, that thou wast driven back?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 10
          },
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye mountains, that ye skipped like rams; and ye little hills, like lambs?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 18
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Tremble, thou earth, at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Which turned the rock into a standing water, the flint into a fountain of waters.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "Ex. 17:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 26
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
